Z||000000||1FieroGTRacingInc||07-21-2000||04:14 PM||||Today I was going down a stretch of Hwy.(Hwy.155South) that was a 55 speed limit...   and of course I was going 60 or so... the hwy. turn's into a 4 lane with a shoulder on either side,REALLY WDE OPEN and SAFE!!!!! <BR>Just as we topped the small hill entering that stretch a new model RX7 blew by me doing 70-75...  I just giggled...  I saw NO TURBO  emblem on it so....  I just gave it 3/4 throttle ... I changed lanes  to get behind him(maybe catch a draft off him).. I was 3-5 feet on his a** by the time we hit 85...  as we approached 95, I changed lanes and pulled aside him at 100, and I smiled at him with his mouth was wide open..Then i gave it full throttle and left him....  I was 3-5 car length's ahead of him and let off and a she passed me he waved and the passenger gave the ok sign and was smiling like he just got a suprise...  LOL was  a BLAST...   <P>Does anyone know what the new model rx7's have in them???     <BR>             <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> Steve.. 85gt,87gt,84-2m4||||reg||6
